    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [50, 1020],
      "size": [600, 450],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 29,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX-2.3 V2V AnimateDiff Cleanup — 24GB (RTX 4090 / RunPod)\n\n=== PURPOSE ===\nRe-detail and clean up ~15s AnimateDiff renders (24fps, 1080p source).\nRemove undescribable detail, fix blur, smooth jittery motion.\nTwo-pass LTX pipeline + SeedVR2 super-resolution upscaling.\n\n=== VRAM ===\nTarget: 24GB (RTX 4090/3090) on RunPod\nLoader: CheckpointLoaderSimple (fp8)\nProfile: mid_vram_12_24gb\nSeedVR2: 3B fp8, no BlockSwap, model cached\n\n=== IC-LORA STACK ===\n1. distilled_lora (1.0) — REQUIRED for 8-step fast pipeline\n2. iclora_deblur (0.6) — sharpen out-of-focus / blurry video [GATED]\n3. iclora_decompression (0.7) — remove compression artifacts [GATED]\n4. omninft_rl_lora (2.0) — general quality boost\n\n=== TWO-PASS LTX PIPELINE ===\nPass 1: 768x432, 8 steps, euler, linear_quadratic\n  → Base V2V generation from conditioned input\nPass 2: 1536x864, 3 steps, euler, ManualSigmas (0.85, 0.725, 0.4219, 0.0)\n  → Refine 2x-upscaled latent via LTXVLatentUpsampler\n\n=== BYPASSABLE STAGES ===\nRight-click → Bypass on any stage to skip it:\n\nStage B: Pass 2 Latent Upscale (nodes 20-24)\n  ON:  768x432 → 1536x864 (refine detail at 2x)\n  OFF: 768x432 output directly (fast preview)\n\nStage C: SeedVR2 Upscale (nodes 30-32)\n  ON:  Super-resolution to target resolution + color correction\n  OFF: Skip upscaling (use LTX output as-is)\n\n=== OUTPUT MODES ===\nPreview:  bypass B+C → 768x432 @ 24fps\nDefault: B on, C off  → 1536x864 @ 24fps\n1080p:   B+C on       → 1920x1080 @ 24fps (resolution=1080)\n4K:      B off, C on  → 3072x1728 @ 24fps (resolution=2160)\n\n=== SEEDVR2 PARAMETERS ===\nModel: seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors (3B, fp8)\nVAE: ema_vae_fp16.safetensors (no tiling on 24GB)\nBlockSwap: 0 (not needed on 24GB)\nbatch_size: 9 (4n+1 pattern, better temporal coherence)\ntemporal_overlap: 4 (blend between batches)\ncolor_correction: lab (perceptual color matching — fixes drift)\nresolution: 2160 (target shortest edge → ~4K from 768x432)\n\nFor 1080p output: set resolution=1080\nFor 4K output: set resolution=2160 (default)\n\n=== BRAVE VARIANT: TRUE 1080p BASE ===\nChange ImageScale (node 12) to 960x544:\n  Pass 2 → 1920x1088 (exact 1080p)\n  SeedVR2 resolution=1080 to clean up at native res\n  Risk: OOM at 361 frames. Mitigations:\n  - Set use_tiled_encode=true on node 13\n  - Set LTXVTiledVAEDecode to 2x2 tiles\n  - Use COMFYUI_ARGS=--lowvram\n\n=== GATED LORAS ===\niclora_deblur + iclora_decompression require HF_TOKEN:\n1. Visit https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Deblur\n   and https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.3-22b-IC-LoRA-Decompression\n2. Click 'Agree and Access' on each\n3. export HF_TOKEN=hf_...\n4. ./scripts/install_ltx23.sh --profile mid_vram_12_24gb\n\n=== SEEDVR2 MODELS ===\nAuto-download on first use to models/seedvr2/.\n3B fp8 DiT (~6GB) + fp16 VAE (~500MB).\nFor RunPod: pre-download to network volume.\n\n=== RETAKE (SECTION REPAIR) ===\nIf specific frame ranges still need fixing after this pass:\n  Use ltx23_v2v_animatediff_retake_24gb.json\n  It uses LTXVAudioVideoMask to regenerate only the problem frames.\n  Requires KJNodes (now in add-dependancies.sh)."
      ],
